{"lines":{"1":{"character":"","next_id":"2","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie la sorcière vit paisiblement dans la petite ville de Toussaint-Sainte-Peur.","type":"dialogue"},"12":{"character":"","next_id":"13","replacements":[],"text":"Mais rien ne presse ...","type":"dialogue"},"13":{"condition":null,"next_id":"14","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["13","18"],"text":"Boire une lampée","type":"response"},"14":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"tea 30 10 0.6\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_item","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"15","type":"mutation"},"15":{"character":"","next_id":"16","replacements":[],"text":"Mmh, au bon goût de citrouille ! Sa tisane préférée.","type":"dialogue"},"16":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"tea\""],"lhs_function":"remove_item","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"17","type":"mutation"},"17":{"next_id":"12","type":"goto"},"18":{"condition":null,"next_id":"19","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir les citrouilles","type":"response"},"19":{"next_id":"22","type":"goto"},"2":{"character":"","next_id":"3","replacements":[],"text":"Sa spécialité ? Les potions !","type":"dialogue"},"22":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"champ\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"23","type":"mutation"},"23":{"character":"","next_id":"24","replacements":[],"text":"Mais ?! Où sont elles passées, ce n'est pas possible ! Plus une courge à l'horizon !","type":"dialogue"},"24":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"25","replacements":[],"text":"Ce n'est pas possible ?! Halloween est demain !","type":"dialogue"},"25":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"26","replacements":[],"text":" Comment vais-je faire ?!","type":"dialogue"},"26":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 30 20 0.4\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"27","type":"mutation"},"27":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"28","replacements":[],"text":"Oh là là...","type":"dialogue"},"28":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"29","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme, c'est toi ? Je t'en prie, as-tu vu quelque chose ?","type":"dialogue"},"29":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"30","replacements":[],"text":"Oh... On est dans de beaux draps...","type":"dialogue"},"3":{"character":"","next_id":"4","replacements":[],"text":"Sur son petit cottage, se dresse une maison à pattes de poules, ainsi qu'un champ de citrouilles.","type":"dialogue"},"30":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"31","type":"mutation"},"31":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"32","replacements":[],"text":"Enfin, ce n'est pas le moment de me laisser tomber, reviens !","type":"dialogue"},"32":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 45 10 0.6\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"33","type":"mutation"},"33":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"34","replacements":[],"text":"Je... J'ai vu... Enfin... Il faisait nuit...","type":"dialogue"},"34":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"35","replacements":[],"text":"(Un jour, j'en ferais ma taie d'oreiller...)","type":"dialogue"},"35":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"36","replacements":[],"text":"Si je ne trouve pas de solution, je devrais me trouver un nouvel endroit pour vivre !","type":"dialogue"},"36":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"37","replacements":[],"text":"Ce jour là, Fantôme, tu pourras dire adieu à l'adoucissant !","type":"dialogue"},"37":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"38","type":"mutation"},"38":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 35 20 0.70\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"39","type":"mutation"},"39":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"40","replacements":[],"text":"Très bien, très bien ! Ecoute, ça va te paraitre bizarre...","type":"dialogue"},"4":{"character":"","next_id":"5","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie est très fière de ses citrouilles.","type":"dialogue"},"40":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"41","replacements":[],"text":"Ne te froisse pas... C'est comme si tes citrouilles avaient pris vie, et s'étaient enfuies !","type":"dialogue"},"41":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"42","replacements":[],"text":"Quoi ?! Comment ça ? Mais où sont-elles allées ?","type":"dialogue"},"42":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"43","replacements":[],"text":"C'est pas moi...","type":"dialogue"},"43":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"44","replacements":[],"text":"Voyons, ne te froisse pas ! Dis moi simplement où les trouver.","type":"dialogue"},"44":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"45","replacements":[],"text":"Elles sont allées vers la ville... Je n'ose aller voir...","type":"dialogue"},"45":{"next_id":"48","type":"goto"},"48":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"49","replacements":[],"text":"Mon dieu... Qu'ont-elles fait là bas... Que leur est-il arrivé ?!","type":"dialogue"},"49":{"condition":null,"next_id":"50","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["49","52"],"text":"Tomber dans les citrouilles","type":"response"},"5":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"salon\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"6","type":"mutation"},"50":{"character":"","next_id":"51","replacements":[],"text":"Allons Léonnie... Courage, ce n'est pas le moment de faillir !","type":"dialogue"},"51":{"next_id":"48","type":"goto"},"52":{"condition":null,"next_id":"53","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir en ville","type":"response"},"53":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"54","type":"mutation"},"54":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"55","type":"mutation"},"55":{"next_id":"58","type":"goto"},"58":{"character":"","next_id":"","replacements":[],"text":"oh bah di dont les embrouillaminis","type":"dialogue"},"6":{"character":"","next_id":"7","replacements":[],"text":"Buvant une infusion de ses cucurbitacés préférés, elle se prépare à sortir voir son potager.","type":"dialogue"},"7":{"character":"","next_id":"8","replacements":[],"text":"Ayant répandu la veille sa fameuse potion revigorante pour citrouille, elle a hâte de voir le résultat.","type":"dialogue"},"8":{"character":"","next_id":"9","replacements":[],"text":"Leonnie est en effet chargé de décorer la ville pour Halloween, avec ses somptueuses citrouilles !","type":"dialogue"},"9":{"next_id":"12","type":"goto"}},"titles":{"01 Start":"1","02 Waiting":"12","03 Destination":"48","03 Pumpkins":"22","04 Quiproquo":"58"}}